    "extract": "Akshay Kumar Parija is an Indian filmmaker known for his depictions of Odia culture and Odissi dance in his films. He is the first Odia to have a film, Papa Buka (2025) nominated for the 98th Academy Awards. Originally he is a banker and currently lives in Dubai.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Akshay Kumar Parija</b> is an Indian filmmaker known for his depictions of Odia culture and Odissi dance in his films. He is the first Odia to have a film, Papa Buka (2025) nominated for the 98th Academy Awards. Originally he is a banker and currently lives in Dubai.</p>"
